data-grid-gb / conventional: third-party data terms
====================================================

Code is Apache-2.0 (root LICENSE and NOTICE, via PR #1). The DATA keeps its
publishers' terms, listed per source id in sources.json. Quotes are short
extracts; the URL is the authority.

