  https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/
  "You are free to: copy, publish, distribute and transmit the Information; adapt
  the Information; exploit the Information commercially and non-commercially".
  Attribution: Contains public sector information licensed under the Open
  Government Licence v3.0.

wri-gppd  (open: yes)
  World Resources Institute, Global Power Plant Database v1.3.0 (2021). CC BY 4.0.
