Vendored lane (conventional/lanes/dc-a6, see lanes.json)
---------------------------------------------------------
dc-a6 (DC-A6)  Built from:
  - NAEI 2023 point sources, via the GridAtlas offtakers file: OGL v3.0, "published by
    Defra, DESNZ and the Devolved Governments under the Open Government Licence"
    (https://naei.energysecurity.gov.uk/data/maps);
  - OpenStreetMap power=plant: ODbL 1.0, © OpenStreetMap contributors;
  - WRI GPPD v1.3.0: CC BY 4.0 (citation above);
  - REPD Q2 2026 (DESNZ): OGL v3.0, used ONLY to exclude renewable-scope sites and
    never copied;
  - inputs/status_curated.csv: facts curated by GridAtlas R-otdata, each row citing its
    source URL.
  The output is an ODbL database because it contains OSM data. Filtering on each
  feature's sources[] gives the OGL + CC BY subset.
